abstract: >
  Open-source Object A: MoE expert orbit prefetch from embedding/residual signals
  for DeepSeek-style open MoE (DeepSeek-V2-Lite and GigaChat lab paths), sparse
  runtime, math docs, and lean laptop-lab evidence. Apache-2.0; attribution for
  substantial product use (ATTRIBUTION.md). Weights not redistributed. Not a
  drop-in for every MoE without an adapter (see docs/SUPPORTED_MODELS.md).
